<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 476 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 476 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's balance sheet for the week to May 23 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to May 15  SPFC :</p>
<p>					Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 58,496	58,945</p>
<p> Money market intervention    12,568	14,785</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,908	 1,908</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,909	 1,912</p>
<p> Other				 6,610	 6,622</p>
<p> Total assets		     81,464	84,172</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>In the previous week, to May 15, reserves rose by 318 million markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
